From db076f05820b4925969913adaf01a8bf9480b469 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: EYC <e@eyc.one>
Date: Fri, 24 Jul 2026 19:04:28 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 08/56] drm/msm: cmd-mode DSC 1.2 fixes for DPU 13 (Kaanapali)

Fixes needed to drive the OnePlus 15 panel in command mode with
native 4:2:2 DSC 1.2 on DPU 13: correct the bpp double-doubling for
native 4:2:2/4:2:0, fix the DSC initial line count for DSC-merge, set
ENC_DF_CTRL FULL_ICH_PREC for >8bpc, program the PPB latency FIFO
size on DPU 12+, keep DSC_CFG bit17 off on extended-ctl native-422
wrappers, fix STREAM0_TOTAL H_TOTAL for widebus command mode, stop
over-deriving the DSI link rate, and wire pingpong DSC ops for the
DPU 13 command-mode feed. Adds DSPP support for pentile SPR using the
panel's stock AD296 calibration.

[y705 rebase 7.3: two dsi_host hunks hardcoding slice_per_pkt=2 dropped: 7.3 packs slices per MIPI_DSI_MODE_DSC_ALL_SLICES_IN_PKT, which our panel now sets (vendor qcom,mdss-dsc-slice-per-pkt = 2)]
y705-source: 0002-drm-msm-cmd-mode-DSC-1.2-fixes-for-DPU-13-Kaanapali.patch
